{"body":"\u003c!-- greptile_summary --\u003e\n\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://app.greptile.com/api/retrigger?id=95217837\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/RetriggerDark.svg?v=2\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Retrigger\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\" align=\"right\"\u003e\u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://app.greptile.com/-/switch-tenant?tenant=curatelabs\u0026amp;next=%2FCurateLabs%2Fxyg%2Fpull%2F1092\u0026amp;utm_source=greptile_review\u0026amp;utm_medium=github\u0026amp;utm_campaign=view_in_greptile\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptileDark.svg?v=2\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptile.svg?v=2\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"View in Greptile\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptile.svg?v=2\" align=\"right\"\u003e\u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/a\u003eConfidence Score: 4/5\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n**[Medium impact]** The behavior changes are limited to the experimental retained WASM graph attachment and its supporting documentation and evidence\\.\n\nFix the skipped slot ancestors before merging; transformed slotted graphs can change the wrong selection.\n\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://app.greptile.com/ide/claude-code?prompt=%23%23%23%20Issue%201%0Ajs%2Fsrc%2F63_graph_controller.ts%3A187-188%0AIf%20%60options.el%60%20is%20slotted%20into%20a%20custom%20element%2C%20this%20walk%20jumps%20straight%20from%20the%20container%20to%20its%20host.%20It%20skips%20the%20slot%20and%20its%20shadow-tree%20parents%2C%20so%20a%20rotation%20or%20active%20motion%20path%20on%20a%20wrapper%20around%20the%20slot%20goes%20unchecked.%0A%0AThe%20canvas%E2%80%99s%20rotated%20bounding%20rectangle%20is%20then%20treated%20as%20axis-aligned.%20Clicking%20a%20visible%20node%20can%20select%20something%20else%20or%20clear%20selection%20instead%20of%20passing%20through%20without%20a%20command.%20Follow%20%60assignedSlot%60%20before%20%60parentElement%60%2C%20or%20reject%20slotted%20containers%2C%20and%20add%20a%20regression%20for%20a%20transformed%20wrapper%20around%20a%20slot.%0A%0A---%0A%0AFor%20each%20issue%20above%2C%20determine%20whether%20it%20is%20valid%20and%20should%20be%20fixed.%20If%20so%2C%20fix%20it%20directly.\u0026repo=curatelabs%2Fxyg\u0026pr=1092\u0026platform=github\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixAllInClaudeDark.svg?v=7\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixAllInClaude.svg?v=7\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Fix All in Claude Code\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixAllInClaude.svg?v=7\" align=\"right\"\u003e\u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFindings\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n1. \u003cimg alt=\"P1\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;**Slotted graphs select wrong items** \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/CurateLabs/xyg/pull/1092#discussion_r4463052824\"\u003e▶\u003c/a\u003e\n\n\u003cdetails\u003e\u003csummary\u003eFix with agent prompt\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n`````markdown\n### Issue 1\njs/src/63_graph_controller.ts:187-188\nIf `options.el` is slotted into a custom element, this walk jumps straight from the container to its host. It skips the slot and its shadow-tree parents, so a rotation or active motion path on a wrapper around the slot goes unchecked.\n\nThe canvas’s rotated bounding rectangle is then treated as axis-aligned. Clicking a visible node can select something else or clear selection instead of passing through without a command. Follow `assignedSlot` before `parentElement`, or reject slotted containers, and add a regression for a transformed wrapper around a slot.\n\n---\n\nFor each issue above, determine whether it is valid and should be fixed. If so, fix it directly.\n`````\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n\u003cdetails open\u003e\u003csummary\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSummary\u003c/h3\u003e\u003c/summary\u003e\n\nAdds primary-click selection to the experimental retained WASM graph attachment.\n- Canvas clicks in the retained WASM graph select items through Rust.\n\n`DecisionNerd` explicitly defers hover, gestures, public hosts, scale qualification, and broader acceptance. The labelled refusal seams are intentional; they are not presented as successful large-selection tests.\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n\u003cdetails open\u003e\u003csummary\u003e\u003ch3\u003eDiagram\u003c/h3\u003e\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n```mermaid\n%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%\nflowchart LR\n  A[Canvas click] --\u003e B{Live, idle, current?}\n  B -- No --\u003e C[Leave browser default]\n  B -- Yes --\u003e D{Supported presentation?}\n  D -- No --\u003e C\n  D -- Yes --\u003e E[Map to accepted CSS viewport]\n  E --\u003e F[Serialized SelectAt request]\n  F --\u003e G[Rust picks and updates selection]\n  G --\u003e H[Validate complete reply]\n  H --\u003e I[Paint and publish selection snapshot]\n```\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- greptile_confidence_score:4 --\u003e\n\n\u003csub\u003eReviews (1) · Last reviewed commit: [\"Merge approved attachment parent into po...\"](https://github.com/curatelabs/xyg/commit/da52bca32651077ddf53d9fdd014245731b6d087) · [Reviewed by Greptile](https://www.greptile.com/?utm_source=greptile_review\u0026utm_medium=github\u0026utm_campaign=review_public\u0026utm_content=curatelabs/xyg)\u003c/sub\u003e","html_url":"https://github.com/CurateLabs/xyg/pull/1092#issuecomment-6621295474","id":6621295474,"updated_at":"2026-11-04T02:57:07Z"}
